# orders-api

**Verdict: INFEASIBLE.** 99.95% is not possible: even if everything you own were perfect, dependencies cap you at 99.915%. Add redundancy to the dependencies or promise the 99.90% tier.

| | Availability | Downtime per window |
|---|---|---|
| Target | 99.95% | 21.6 min |
| Computed | 99.905% | 41.0 min |
| Dependency ceiling | 99.915% | 36.7 min |

Recommended tier: **99.90%**. Window: 30 days.

